						 <div class="info-container"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">&nbsp;</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">&nbsp;</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div> <p><strong>SCP-4428</strong> <span class="lie">Michaels 博士沒有處於危險之中。</span><br /> <strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/henzoid" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5190300&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606116289" alt="Henzoid" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5190300)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/henzoid" >Henzoid</a></span>与<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lt-flops" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1735419&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606116289" alt="Lt Flops" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1735419)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lt-flops" >Lt Flops</a></span><br /> <strong>譯者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/feitag" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4357011&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606116289" alt="feitag" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4357011)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/feitag" >feitag</a></span></p> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><strong>作者的更多作品：</strong><br /> <span style="font-size:130%;"><strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/henzoids-author-page" target="_blank">Henzoid</a></strong><br /> <strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/floppyphoenix" target="_blank">Lt Flops</a></strong></span></p> </div> <hr /> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><span style="font-size:110%;"><strong>特別感謝 - 批評者 &amp; 測試版讀者</strong></span></p> </div> <ul> <li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/caimanchameleon" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3151572&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606116289" alt="CaimanChameleon" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3151572)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/caimanchameleon" >CaimanChameleon</a></span></li> <li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/plaidypus" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4187161&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606116289" alt="plaidypus" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4187161)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/plaidypus" >plaidypus</a></span></li> <li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/darkstuff" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1581620&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606116289" alt="DarkStuff" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1581620)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/darkstuff" >DarkStuff</a></span></li> <li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/psychicprogrammer" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5299606&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606116289" alt="psychicprogrammer" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5299606)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/psychicprogrammer" >psychicprogrammer</a></span></li> <li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/maliceaforethought" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2902864&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606116289" alt="MaliceAforetho