%B8%80%E6%AD%A9.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#970118"><strong>一小步</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>发布一篇文档</strong></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>因为是神风，死得很快</strong></span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E6%8E%A1%E7%94%A8%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E6%8E%A1%E7%94%A8%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#970118"><strong>录取通知</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>创建人事档案</strong></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>开始想自己的设定</strong></span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E9%8A%85%E3%83%A1%E3%83%80%E3%83%AB.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E9%8A%85%E3%83%A1%E3%83%80%E3%83%AB.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#970118"><strong>铜奖章</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>发布一篇评分15以上的文档</strong></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>SCP-CN-1848，第一篇活下来的文档</strong></span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E9%8A%80%E3%83%A1%E3%83%80%E3%83%AB.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E9%8A%80%E3%83%A1%E3%83%80%E3%83%AB.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#970118"><stron